guide.lpsm_bandages:desc=Welcome to §bBandages§r! This Add-On adds new bandage items to help you survive.\n\n
guide.lpsm_bandages:items.bandages=Bandages
guide.lpsm_bandages:items.bandages.desc=A §lBandage§r is an item used to give the player positive effects.\n\n§lVariants:§r - Bandage\n- Nether Bandage\n-End Bandage\n- Water Bandage\n\n§lUsage:§r When using a bandage, the display zooms in slightly. Charging the bandage to its maximum causes it to visually shake as an indicator. Releasing the button applies effects to the user. Using a bandage can be canceled by switching to another hotbar slot while holding use. If you fail to charge the bandage to its maximum it will fail to apply the effects and won't be consumed.\n\n§lObtain:§r Found in loot chests.\n\n

